  #line-at(68.64pt, 215.52pt, "literature. ")
  #line-at(79.32pt, 227.16pt, "The aim of this work is to analyse the non-ideal current ")
  #line-at(68.64pt, 238.92pt, "mechanisms present in GaN SBDs and to investigate their ")
  #line-at(68.64pt, 250.56pt, "differences as a function of the substrate. The article is ")
  #line-at(68.64pt, 262.08pt, "organized as follows. In section 2, we include the structures of ")
  #line-at(68.64pt, 273.84pt, "the measured diodes. In section 3, the results are discussed to ")
  #line-at(68.64pt, 285.48pt, "identify the non-ideal current mechanisms. Finally, in section ")
  #line-at(68.64pt, 297.24pt, "4 the main conclusions of our work are summarized. ")
